note as DeletionPolicyNote
Deletion / archiving rule:

Do not physically delete documents, payments, stock movements or posted history.
Use status transitions, reversal documents and refund payments instead.

For reference data, prefer status=inactive for hiding from new operations.
Use deletedAt only as soft delete; old documents must still be able to display snapshots and linked records.
end note


note as AuditFieldsNote
Audit fields rule:
createdBy/updatedBy are stored on admin-managed reference data
(Product, ProductPrice, Warehouse, Customer, Supplier, Unit, InventoryReason, Category).
Technical stock tables like WarehouseStock, WarehouseStockBatch and StockMovement
should be created/updated by posting inventory documents, not manually.
Their responsible user is traced through InventoryDocument, Payment or StatusHistory.
end note

@enduml
